generalization/reviews/G2/sol_abstract.err-369-available): C = census flag; L = rule-1 detection (detection-only, no
generalization/reviews/G2/sol_abstract.err-370-frequency requirement — symmetric margins). Report the full 2x2, both
generalization/reviews/G2/sol_abstract.err-371-discordant fractions, union completeness, and incremental yields
generalization/reviews/G2/sol_abstract.err:372:P(C=1,L=0), P(C=0,L=1) with intervals (Wilson for D3/D1; cluster bootstrap
generalization/reviews/G2/sol_abstract.err-373-for D2). Exact McNemar is SECONDARY (marginal-homogeneity only; it does not
