generalization/reviews/G2/sol_stats2.err:593:    50	   Reporting all four rules reduces selective omission, but separate 95% Wilson intervals remain pointwise, not simultaneous. Rule 4 is a deterministic union rather than an independent detector. The larger multiplicity comes from rules × passes × classes × datasets × surfaces × 18 D2 scenarios.
