generalization/reviews/G2/sol_stats2.err:598:    55	   The min–max over a finite grid is a sensitivity range, not a confidence band and not a single population estimand. It is also unclear whether “across the ladder” means nine bandpass combinations or all 18 combinations including de-dilution ([METRICS_SPEC.md:58](/Users/jackneo/Documents/vonhippel-base9/astro-wd/generalization/METRICS_SPEC.md:58)). Selected extrema have additional sampling variability.
