generalization/reviews/G2/sol_stats2.err-607-    64	11. **BLOCKER — The 1,000-null design does not estimate operational D2 FPR.**  
generalization/reviews/G2/sol_stats2.err:608:    65	    Arm-A nulls estimate false alarms under synthetic Gaussian noise on the chosen window distribution—not under real ZTF heteroskedasticity, correlations, outliers, or systematics ([GENERALIZATION_PLAN.md:128](/Users/jackneo/Documents/vonhippel-base9/astro-wd/generalization/GENERALIZATION_PLAN.md:128)). Calling arm-B nulls tautological correctly recognizes that selecting templates because they were previously “not detected” conditions on the outcome. The sampling frame for “1,000 distinct windows” is also unexplained relative to the 510-star template frame.
