generalization/reviews/G1/sol_referee.err-580-   109	  retractions (TIC 261400271, 804835539, 317620456) and updated mode lists
generalization/reviews/G1/sol_referee.err-581-   110	  for re-observed 2022 objects — latest published solution wins.
generalization/reviews/G1/sol_referee.err-582-   111	- Truth model, not interpolation (`d2_truth_model.py`): DAV P < 240 s is
generalization/reviews/G1/sol_referee.err-583-   112	  super-Nyquist AND past the first sinc null of TESS 120-s data; the mode
generalization/reviews/G1/sol_referee.err:584:   113	  table is evaluated analytically at the template's real `bjd_tdb`.
generalization/reviews/G1/sol_referee.err-585-   114	  Chain: ppt → mag (×1.0857e-3) → de-dilution OFF by default (SPOC PDCSAP is
generalization/reviews/G1/sol_referee.err-586-   115	  crowding-corrected; ON = prespecified variant) → de-integrate TESS sinc
generalization/reviews/G1/sol_referee.err-587-   116	  (reject modes with |sinc| < 0.3, i.e. P < 197 s from 120-s data; prefer
generalization/reviews/G1/sol_referee.err:588:   117	  20-s cadence solutions) → bandpass ladder A_g/A_TESS ∈ {1.4, 1.7, 2.1} ×
generalization/reviews/G1/sol_referee.err-589-   118	  A_r/A_g ∈ {0.70, 0.80, 0.90} (nominal 1.7/0.80 from an in-code blackbody
generalization/reviews/G1/sol_referee.err:590:   119	  derivative; the ladder is non-optional — zr carries most published
generalization/reviews/G1/sol_referee.err-591-   120	  confirmations) → re-integrate ZTF 30-s sinc analytically → compose
generalization/reviews/G1/sol_referee.err-592-   121	  phase-coherently in zg and zr (shared t_ref) so the frozen two-band rule
generalization/reviews/G1/sol_referee.err-593-   122	  keeps its meaning.
generalization/reviews/G1/sol_referee.err:594:   123	- Windows: templates from the 510 not-detected stars of the published run,
generalization/reviews/G1/sol_referee.err:595:   124	  matched by median zg mag (|Δg| ≤ 0.25), K=3 templates per target at
generalization/reviews/G1/sol_referee.err:596:   125	  10/50/90th percentile of exposures-per-night (75% of zg nights are
generalization/reviews/G1/sol_referee.err-597-   126	  single-exposure; per-night median subtraction annihilates 53% of zg data —
generalization/reviews/G1/sol_referee.err-598-   127	  D2 largely measures that penalty; pre-registered, stratified: risk 3).
generalization/reviews/G1/sol_referee.err-599-   128	- Arms: B primary (signal + real ZTF mags, real magerr), A diagnostic
generalization/reviews/G1/sol_referee.err-600-   129	  (synthetic Gaussian floor). FPR: 1,000 arm-A zero-amplitude nulls over
generalization/reviews/G1/sol_referee.err:601:   130	  1,000 distinct real windows (Wilson upper ~0.4% at zero confirmed);
generalization/reviews/G1/sol_referee.err:602:   131	  arm-B nulls are tautological (templates ARE the not-detected set).
generalization/reviews/G1/sol_referee.err-603-   132	  Verification arm: ~20 SPOC light curves prewhitened to confirm published
