generalization/GENERALIZATION_PLAN.md-173-  De-dilution variant runs only for the SPOC verification-arm stars (dilution
generalization/GENERALIZATION_PLAN.md-174-  factors are not in the papers; CROWDSAP comes with the ~20 downloads).
generalization/GENERALIZATION_PLAN.md-175-  Post-G1 additions: paired controls (~<=309, prefix 95) and a phase-draw
generalization/GENERALIZATION_PLAN.md:176:  sensitivity axis (2 extra deterministic phase draws x 103 targets on the
generalization/GENERALIZATION_PLAN.md:177:  median template, arm B nominal) ≈ +515 runs; total ≈ 2,960 ≈ 1.5 d.
generalization/GENERALIZATION_PLAN.md-178-- Truth-model corrections found at implementation (2026-08-28): |sinc| ≥ 0.3
generalization/GENERALIZATION_PLAN.md-179-  rejection corresponds to P < ~160 s at 120-s cadence (the earlier "197 s"
generalization/GENERALIZATION_PLAN.md-180-  was the |sinc| = 0.5 point); D2 min published period is 115.9 s and 49/103
generalization/GENERALIZATION_PLAN.md-181-  stars carry 20-s solutions, so few modes are affected. Phases are
generalization/GENERALIZATION_PLAN.md-182-  unpublished: drawn once per star from PCG64(seed=TIC), shared across bands
generalization/GENERALIZATION_PLAN.md:183:  and ladder variants. Blackbody derivative at 11,500 K gives (1.43, 0.80) —
generalization/GENERALIZATION_PLAN.md:184:  the ladder's low rung; upper rungs cover atmosphere-model/limb-darkening
generalization/GENERALIZATION_PLAN.md-185-  uncertainty.
generalization/GENERALIZATION_PLAN.md-186-
