generalization/GENERALIZATION_PLAN.md-223-- W3 (Sep 11–17): D3 full run (laptop) ∥ D2 (desktop); metrics+plots against
generalization/GENERALIZATION_PLAN.md-224-  pilot output; G4.
generalization/GENERALIZATION_PLAN.md:225:- W4 (Sep 18–25): metrics, ladders, figures, bundles, acceptance; G5;
generalization/GENERALIZATION_PLAN.md-226-  cross-dataset synthesis table.
generalization/GENERALIZATION_PLAN.md-227-- Sep 26–30: abstract + G6; submit.
